\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces End-to-end flow: seeded option rendering, three-round debate, claim decomposition, claim-domain retrieval, verifier labels, logit accumulation with one softmax and a simplex projection, one-shot injection during revision, and trust-weighted aggregation using the final trust vector.}}{3}{figure.1.1}%
