\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Context diagram: questions and rendered options enter; three agents call the vLLM server; claims route by domain to PubMed, arXiv, Semantic Scholar, and OpenAlex; verifier labels update the trust vector; the result package records the final answer, evidence, and final trust vector.}}{13}{figure.3.1}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Level-one data flow: option rendering, debate state, claim decomposition, domain routing, verifier labels, simplex trust update, one-shot injection, and weighted aggregation.}}{14}{figure.3.2}%
