\addvspace {10\p@ }
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces First completed Core row (GPQA-Main, seed~1, 399 eligible pairs; question~27 quarantined). Top left: cumulative accuracy after each question (thin lines) with milestone snapshots and 95\% CIs (markers; B8 circles, control squares). Top right: minority-position retention (MPR) at milestones. Bottom left: collapse rate on evidence-exposed items (CCR-e). Bottom right: mean question-pair time in seconds. The B8 lead (+0.038 at $n=399$) is not significant (exact McNemar $p=0.086$); the figure is read as feasibility and timing evidence.}}{38}{figure.4.1}%
